    "summary": "The root has two principal orientations: gathering or magnitude, and beauty or goodness.",
    "development": "The gathering-and-magnitude branch yields aggregation, groups, thick cables, camels, and camel-like size; the beauty branch yields جمال and جميل and extends to goodness in conduct. These root orientations are related developments, not meanings of every derived form.",
